.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:108:## 4. OPTIONAL TEMPLATES (Any Level)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:110:These templates are OPTIONAL and can be added at any documentation level:
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:114:| `research/research.md` | `research/research.md` | Comprehensive research documentation (Level 3+ typical) | Render `templates/addons/research.md.tmpl` with `inline-gate-renderer --level N --out-dir specs/###-name/research` |
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:123:## 5. FOLDER STRUCTURE BY LEVEL (Progressive Enhancement)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:125:### Level 1: Baseline Documentation
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:132:└── implementation-summary.md    (REQUIRED - from implementation-summary.md, carries `_memory.continuity`)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:140:**Enforcement:** `FILE_EXISTS` fails strict validation when a required file is missing
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:144:### Level 2: Verification Added
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:151:├── implementation-summary.md    (REQUIRED - from Level 1)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:152:└── acceptance-criteria.md       (REQUIRED - gates packet closure, scaffolded at this level)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:156:- **acceptance-criteria.md**: one row per criterion, each Met, Waived or Superseded before the packet may close; the verification checklist lives in tasks.md
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:158:**Enforcement:** `AC_CLOSURE` fails when `acceptance-criteria.md` is absent from a packet created after 2026-08-30
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:162:### Level 3: Full Documentation
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:169:├── implementation-summary.md    (REQUIRED - from Level 2)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:170:├── acceptance-criteria.md       (from Level 2)
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:178:**Enforcement:** `FILE_EXISTS` fails strict validation when a required file is missing. An absent `decision-record.md` is skipped
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:182:### Level 3+: Extended Documentation
