.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:204:## 6. TEMPLATE STRUCTURE REQUIREMENTS
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:206:All templates follow consistent structure:
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:208:### 1. H2 Sections
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/assets/template-mapping.md:216:- Keep the heading text the template ships; `tasks.md` and `implementation-summary.md` use unnumbered headings such as `## Phase 1: Setup` and `## What Was Built`
