.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/references/typescript/style-guide/formatting-imports-and-coexistence.md:263:**Key difference from JSDoc**: TSDoc does not use `{type}` annotations in tags because TypeScript has native type annotations. Compare:
